      "image": "assets/images/75861/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place pork tenderloin and soup mix in a slow cooker. Pour water, wine, and balsamic vinegar on top, turning pork to coat. Spread garlic evenly over pork, leaving as much on top as possible. Season with pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l6CY3SdYOH7QkTNp-TTD9E6D5ug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75861-amazing-pork-tenderloin-in-the-slow-cooker-ddmfs-step-03-3x4-1210-6e15cb6a465643d7b095920ba1d40319.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75861/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and cook on Low until the internal temperature reaches 145 degrees F (63 degrees C), 2 to 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f5kNOk5tL4mfBFvde__uz-6sd5M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75861-amazing-pork-tenderloin-in-the-slow-cooker-ddmfs-step-04-3x4-1324-f4a66e1c093d4d9c966e3d8b52f844e3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75861/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove pork from the slow cooker; let rest for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zZjxDBJmqoDHeCnv7O-TxgrNj1Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/75861-amazing-pork-tenderloin-in-the-slow-cooker-ddmfs-step-05-3x4-1326-6109d213a5eb421592b61ecb587d589a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/75861/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice pork tenderloin and serve with cooking liquid on the side as au jus. Enjoy!",
